# tour.js — Interactive Tutorial Engine (v6)
# File: data/tour.js

## PURPOSE
Step-by-step tutorial guiding new users through the PuckRacer interface. Bilingual (en/de).

## STRUCTURE
- tourTexts: Bilingual content object (en/de) with step_* keys
- tourSteps[]: Array of step definitions with page, target, textKey, placement, etc.
- Persisted in sessionStorage: pr_tour_step, pr_tour_lang

## TUTORIAL FLOW
1. Welcome screen with 3D CSS puck animation
2. Language selection (step_lang)
3. Status bar explanation
4. Filter bar explanation
5-11. Shuttle Run game walkthrough (setup → names → run → home)

## KEY FUNCTIONS
- injectTourHTML(): Create overlay + bubble + welcome screen DOM
- showWelcomeScreen(): 3D puck animation with RGB glow
- showTourStep(): Highlight target element, show tutorial bubble
- tourNextStep(): Advance to next step
- endTutorial(): Exit and cleanup
- handleLangStep(): Allow language selection during tutorial

## STEP FORMAT
{ page, type, target (CSS selector), textKey, requireClick, requireInteraction, allowInteraction, placement, arrow }
